# This Vercel project hosts only the /api/chat function — the static app and
# its audio library stay on GitHub Pages (see plan: hosting decision). Keep
# the Vercel deployment lean by excluding everything that function doesn't need.
public/audio
dist
server
scripts/cache-event-audio.js
scripts/cache-event-details-audio.js
playwright-report
test-results
tests
*.md
# Except the battle videos' sources (content/battle-videos/<event id>/sources.md): the
# content build checks them and the chat KB build reads them.
!content/battle-videos/**/sources.md
